message: "Pre-release metadata for the unpublished v1.6.0 candidate. DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21847543 is reserved but not yet public or citable; cite the latest archived release until publication."
type: software
title: "Governance Drift: Reproducibility Package"
version: 1.6.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Bessa Rocha da Silva"
    given-names: "Obede"
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Clermont, Florida, United States"
